From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Subject: Exynos7870 audio stage 2: COD3026X playback codec and J701F sound card (local)

Written by Claude 2026-10-09 for the J701F project; not an upstream patch.
Ported from the vendor 3.18 cod3026x.c, exynos-audmixer.c and
universal7870-cod3026.c (Samsung Electronics, GPL-2.0); see
build/kernel/vendor-audio-reference/SOURCE.txt. Applies after
linux-audio-exynos7870-lpass.patch.
---
--- a/sound/soc/samsung/Makefile
+++ b/sound/soc/samsung/Makefile
@@ -11,6 +11,7 @@
 obj-$(CONFIG_SND_SAMSUNG_PCM) += snd-soc-pcm.o
 obj-$(CONFIG_SND_SAMSUNG_I2S) += snd-soc-i2s.o
 obj-$(CONFIG_SND_SAMSUNG_I2S) += exynos7870-lpass.o
+obj-$(CONFIG_SND_SAMSUNG_I2S) += j701f-cod3026x.o j701f-audio.o
 obj-$(CONFIG_SND_SAMSUNG_I2S) += snd-soc-idma.o
 
 # S3C24XX Machine Support
--- /dev/null
+++ b/sound/soc/samsung/j701f-cod3026x-regs.h
